1
00:00:03,356 --> 00:00:04,256
(Leonard:)Hey.

2
00:00:04,257 --> 00:00:05,827
(Penny:)Hi, how was the screening?

3
00:00:05,825 --> 00:00:07,625
(Leonard:)Oh, Sheldon invoked Rosa Parks

4
00:00:07,627 --> 00:00:10,127
(Leonard:)to make somebody who
cut the line feel bad,

5
00:00:10,129 --> 00:00:14,529
(Leonard:)but only the
white people felt bad.

6
00:00:14,534 --> 00:00:16,734
(Penny:)Ugh, I should've never bought
him that coloring book

7
00:00:16,736 --> 00:00:19,506
(Penny:)that explains
Black History Month.

8
00:00:19,505 --> 00:00:20,935
(Leonard:)How'd it go with my mother?

9
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:22,970
(Penny:)Uh, you know,
it started a little rocky,

10
00:00:22,975 --> 00:00:24,875
(Penny:)but I think we got
to a good place.

11
00:00:24,877 --> 00:00:25,907
(Leonard:)Wow.

12
00:00:25,912 --> 00:00:27,182
(Leonard:)Well done.
(chuckles)

13
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:28,380
(Penny:)Yeah, and when I dropped her off
at the hotel,

14
00:00:28,381 --> 00:00:29,381
(Penny:)she even gave me a hug.

15
00:00:29,382 --> 00:00:32,882
(Leonard:)Did she think
you were choking or...

16
00:00:32,885 --> 00:00:34,315
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, that's great.

17
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:36,050
(Leonard:)Thank you for
spending time with her.

18
00:00:36,055 --> 00:00:37,525
(Penny:)No problem.

19
00:00:37,523 --> 00:00:38,993
(Penny:)Um, so listen,

20
00:00:38,991 --> 00:00:41,791
(Penny:)I don't know if you have
any plans next weekend,

21
00:00:41,794 --> 00:00:43,594
(Penny:)but I kind of promised your mom

22
00:00:43,596 --> 00:00:45,096
(Penny:)we'd have another
wedding ceremony

23
00:00:45,097 --> 00:00:47,197
(Penny:)so she could attend this time.

24
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,270
(Leonard:)Wait, we're gonna
get married again?

25
00:00:50,269 --> 00:00:53,369
(Penny:)Yeah, kind of, but now we can
invite our friends and family.

26
00:00:53,372 --> 00:00:56,072
(Leonard:)Seems like a lot
of trouble for a hug.

27
00:00:56,074 --> 00:00:57,274
(Penny:)Come on, it'll be fun,

28
00:00:57,275 --> 00:00:58,905
(Penny:)and, you know, your mom
was genuinely hurt

29
00:00:58,910 --> 00:01:00,580
(Penny:)we didn't invite her
to the first one.

30
00:01:00,578 --> 00:01:01,978
Look, in our defense,

